<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <IsAotCompatible>true</IsAotCompatible>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>


    <PackageId>SharpAstro.Jbig2</PackageId>
    <Product>SharpAstro.Jbig2</Product>
    <Authors>SharpAstro</Authors>
    <Description>Pure-managed JBIG2 (ITU-T T.88) bilevel image decoder for .NET, written clean-room from the specification and aimed at PDF's /JBIG2Decode filter. A PDF-embedded JBIG2 stream is not a file — it has no file header, its segment dictionaries live out of band in /DecodeParms /JBIG2Globals, and its dimensions come from the image dictionary — so the primary entry point takes exactly those pieces: Jbig2Decoder.Decode(embedded, globals, width, height). Standalone .jb2 files (sequential and random-access organisation) also decode, and register with the SharpAstro.Codecs facade by magic bytes. Scope in 3.7: MQ arithmetic decoder (T.88 Annex E), generic region decoding (GBTEMPLATE 0-3, TPGDON typical prediction, arbitrary AT pixels), page information, and region composition (OR/AND/XOR/XNOR/REPLACE). Not yet implemented: MMR (T.6) coding, symbol dictionary + text region, generic refinement, and halftone regions — those throw NotSupportedException naming the missing feature rather than returning a wrong raster. Output is one byte per pixel (1 = black, T.88's own polarity) plus an 8-bit grey projection; /Decode inversion and ImageMask semantics stay in the caller's PDF layer. AOT-compatible.</Description>
    <PackageTags>jbig2 t88 bilevel pdf jbig2decode image codec decoder aot</PackageTags>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/SharpAstro/Codecs.git</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/SharpAstro/Codecs</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageLicenseFile>UNLICENSE</PackageLicenseFile>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <DebugType>embedded</DebugType>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="../../UNLICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="/" />
    <None Include="../../README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="/" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- IImageDecoder / IDecodedImage contract for the SharpAstro.Codecs facade. -->
    <ProjectReference Include="..\SharpAstro.Codecs.Abstractions\SharpAstro.Codecs.Abstractions.csproj" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub">
      <PrivateAssets>all</PrivateAssets>
      <IncludeAssets>runtime; build; native; contentfiles; analyzers; buildtransitive</IncludeAssets>
    </PackageReference>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="SharpAstro.Codecs.Tests" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
